    "Welcome, COO!": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen, COO!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's painted on the fuselage — usually a short form of your name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was auf dem Rumpf steht — meist eine Kurzform deines Namens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first customer is calling": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein erster Kunde ruft an"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your goal is to build a profitable global airline. You'll start small — one aircraft, one route — and grow it flight by flight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Ziel ist eine profitable, weltweite Fluggesellschaft. Du startest klein — ein Flugzeug, eine Route — und wächst Flug für Flug."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rivals build hubs, go public, and buy airlines. So can you — unlock the full game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Konkurrenten bauen Drehkreuze, gehen an die Börse und kaufen Airlines. Du kannst das auch — schalte das volle Spiel frei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
